      options:
      - A) Wildlife refuge nearby
      - B) Animal crossing zone ahead
      - C) No hunting allowed
      answers: B) Animal crossing zone ahead
      correctAnswerIndex: 1
    - questions: At an uncontrolled four-way intersection, who proceeds first?
      emogis: []
      options:
      - A) The vehicle on the left
      - B) The vehicle on the right
      - C) The vehicle that is larger
      answers: B) The vehicle on the right
      correctAnswerIndex: 1
    - questions: 'What is the default speed limit in residential areas unless otherwise
        posted?  '
      emogis: []
      options:
      - A) 25 mph
      - B) 35 mph
      - C) 20 mph
      answers: A) 25 mph
      correctAnswerIndex: 0
    - questions: 'What is the legal Blood Alcohol Concentration (BAC) limit for adult
        drivers (21+)? '
      emogis: []
      options:
      - A) 0.05%
      - B) 0.08%
      - C) 0.10%
      answers: B) 0.08%
      correctAnswerIndex: 1
    - questions: What does a red-painted curb mean?
      emogis: []
      options:
      - A) Passenger loading zone
      - B) Emergency stopping only
      - C) No stopping, standing, or parking at any time
      answers: C) No stopping, standing, or parking at any time
